## Codebase conventions

Check `.claude/context/conventions/postgres-migrations.md` if it exists in the current project (written by the saga Claude Code plugin, if this repo also uses it). That file is the authoritative project-specific override for this rule and takes precedence over every generic pattern documented above. If the file is absent, apply the generic guidance in this rule as written.
